&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Agents team at Muck Rack is building AI for PR and communications professionals. Our first agent helps customers understand their media coverage. Next, we’re building agents that can plan and carry out multi-step workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take features from idea to production, working across our Python agent runtime, MCP server, and Django/Vue application. You’ll help decide how the technology works, ship it to real customers, and learn from how they use it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help shape what we build next and how we build it. You’ll work with new models, solve real customer problems, and take your ideas from experiment to production. If you want to build agents people actually rely on, we’d like to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build agents that take action.&lt;/strong&gt; Build tools, prompts, guardrails, and multi-turn workflows with memory. Help agents know when to act, ask a question, or hand off to a human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship the full experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Build in-product chat, streaming responses, permission-aware APIs, and our external MCP server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make quality measurable.&lt;/strong&gt; Build evals, catch regressions, and use production feedback to improve quality, latency, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Make decisions about how we build, deploy, and run agents as the product grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years building production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Python skills, including async programming and experience with FastAPI, FastMCP, or Django&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping LLM-powered features or agents to real customers including exposing tools via MCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of prompting, tool use, context management, and where models go wrong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring AI quality and using

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic operates more than 40 product tech teams that each provide an integral part of our customers&#39; experience - from the point they start the app until the moment they hold their groceries in their hands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Tech Lead you will be leading one of these teams and empower them to deliver high-quality, secure and performant solutions for the business we&#39;re building. Together with the Product Owner you will evaluate initiatives and drive roadmap discussions. You&#39;ll design and estimate technical solutions for the presented challenges together with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for the delivery of projects and for developing the skills and strengths of the people working in your team. As a Tech Lead, you&#39;ll lead by example, not by title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t hide what we do. Instead, we open-source with the community that helped us grow. Here&#39;s proof: &lt;a href=&quot;http://picnic.tech&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;http://picnic.tech&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping: &lt;/strong&gt;As a Tech Lead in one of our domains, you&#39;ll work with stakeholders from tech and business to translate requirements into scalable and resilient solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You help the team plan, prioritize and make the right trade-offs. Ensuring business goals are achieved while also realizing your long-term technical vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re the go-to for your product domain – both for your own team and for others who want to build on what you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;You are able to communicate your views both when specifying new features with stakeholders and while providing technical mentorship to your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship: &lt;/strong&gt;You invest in your people. Through real conversations, honest feedback, and hands-on coaching, you help them grow faster than they would anywhere else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;You build it - you run it - you love it. You own the health of your product and the support model behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Java 21/25 (Spring 6 with Spring Boot 3.5, Reactor, Immutables), Maven, RabbitMQ, Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Git, Docker, AWS, Helm, Terraform, Kubernetes, Vault, Datadog, Python 3.x, Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;u

