&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Design Ownership: Lead the end-to-end process from discovery and prototyping to high-fidelity design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Geospatial Interface Design: Create intuitive, powerful geospatial interfaces that translate complex data into actionable insights.&amp;nbsp;&lt;

