&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across NetSuite, Salesforce, DealHub, and our reporting tools, with a strong focus on automation and AI, helping build an FP&amp;amp;A function that is insightful, efficient, and closely connected to the business.&lt;/p&gt;
